{"step_index":886,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-11T23:30:07Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-12T01:30:07+02:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-12T01:30:07+02:00\nFile Path: `file:///mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/tools/antigravity/check.sh`\nTotal Lines: 51\nTotal Bytes: 2182\nShowing lines 1 to 51\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: #!/bin/bash\n2: # check.sh — the ONLY command an agent may run.\n3: #\n4: #   /abs/path/tools/antigravity/check.sh FILE.lean\n5: #\n6: # Lives outside every agent workspace and is hashed by guard.sh: agents can\n7: # write inside their workspace, so a checker kept there could be rewritten into\n8: # anything. It screens the file first (tools/antigravity_handoff.py lint), because\n9: # Lean elaboration can itself run shell commands; then elaborates it with bare\n10: # `lean` and an explicit LEAN_PATH, and prints every theorem's axioms. Nothing\n11: # here depends on $HOME — agents run under a private one — and `lake` is never\n12: # involved (in this project lake deletes Mathlib when it cannot re-clone).\n13: set -uo pipefail\n14: f=\"${1:?usage: check.sh FILE.lean}\"\n15: [ -f \"$f\" ] || { echo \"CHECK: no such file: $f\"; exit 2; }\n16: \n17: ROOT=\"$(cd \"$(dirname \"$(readlink -f \"$0\")\")/../..\" && pwd)\"\n18: # Tool paths come from a protected file, not from the home directory: agents run\n19: # under a private HOME, and on compute nodes `getent passwd` reports a different\n20: # home (/home/<user>@ad…) than the one the tools live in.\n21: ENVF=\"$ROOT/handoff/.agf_env\"\n22: export ELAN_HOME=\"$(grep -m1 '^AGF_ELAN_HOME=' \"$ENVF\" 2>/dev/null | cut -d= -f2-)\"\n23: LEAN=\"$ELAN_HOME/bin/lean\"\n24: [ -x \"$LEAN\" ] || { echo \"CHECK: lean not found (ELAN_HOME='$ELAN_HOME' from $ENVF)\"; exit 2; }\n25: PY=\"$ROOT/.venv/bin/python\"\n26: LP_FILE=\"$ROOT/handoff/.agf_lean_path\"\n27: [ -s \"$LP_FILE